{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser02_title", "source_sha256": "00c0ce9e74c8920549e91cfdfc6750da11c2c1fa44f5b11a4e01341eb634419c", "ja": "星梨花とおでかけ2", "zh": "和星梨花外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d78f1a24e5cf6e02073c332ed2b73433596963b9f60be829f563ab43a8659bcc", "ja": "星梨花とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与星梨花外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser02_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "f14803c584c7576f6cc8f20524997bedb56e236aea7e101481a278366b09e36c", "ja": "五稜郭って、本当に地面にお星さまの形なんですね。\nとっても不思議です……！", "zh": "五棱郭真的在地面上呈现出星星的形状呢。\n真是不可思议……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "802596645daffc2cfee79389b449a4083116d9edfec5f4152cfc5d936c6acb33", "ja": "地上からだとピンと来なかったけど、\nこうして上から見るとよくわかるな。", "zh": "在地面上时还没什么实感，\n像这样从上面看就一目了然了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser02_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "4a079169651cec8d4462d3d62e80ec896b876b31a068f1fbba8a6c36c4fe18ee", "ja": "北海道って、素敵なものがたくさんあるんですね！\nわたし、もっといろいろ見てみたいです。", "zh": "北海道原来有这么多美好的东西！\n我还想再多看看各种各样的景色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "944b0e5156530e7962e463f569d10ff0880fd7adb1f75721e94acc3f5c7b04b2", "ja": "そうだな。そろそろ移動……と、\nその前に食事にしようかな。", "zh": "是啊。差不多该出发了……不过在那之前，先吃点东西吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0d173f1ea190404cda687a5e4864ecb61e86bcc8db0121805b12b4048c88e46b", "ja": "函館の海鮮は、昨日食べたんだよな。あと道南で\n有名なのは焼き鳥と……ん？", "zh": "函馆的海鲜昨天已经吃过了。道南还有名的是烤鸡肉串和……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser02_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "f2d284633b0ffc6ec134a8a20891a6bd6673273262888f7d3c90e95fb301cfa2", "ja": "焼き鳥が有名なんですか！　わたし、\nチキンは大好きです♪", "zh": "烤鸡肉串很有名吗！我最喜欢鸡肉了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7f9fd3ff6e758326a61652e4f06aee0abec2c95b2ea593c84849025eed6c2ca4", "ja": "この辺りでは、焼き鳥は鳥肉じゃなくて、\n豚肉を使うらしい。……なんだか面白いな！", "zh": "听说这一带的烤鸡肉串不用鸡肉，而是用猪肉。……总觉得真有意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser02_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "c877f0168007f14f6aadc6545650d33d2262705a87cf0bf2fbd99602421798bc", "ja": "えっ！？　焼き鳥なのに、豚なんですか？\n北海道、やっぱり不思議がいっぱいです……！", "zh": "咦！？明明是烤鸡肉串，居然用的是猪肉吗？\n北海道果然充满了不可思议……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_022ser02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_022ser02_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "e8e71f40740594081a9babb2d70feaeb14b7d4da5c045ef267976c3af13348cf", "ja": "どんな焼き鳥なのか、さっそく食べに行きましょう、\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "是什么样的烤串呢？我们这就去吃吧，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
